[Episode 6]</font>

32
00:01:38,310 --> 00:01:39,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is a model</font>

33
00:01:39,760 --> 00:01:42,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">showing the deceased after embalming and restorative work.</font>

34
00:01:43,010 --> 00:01:46,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Through arterial perfusion, multipoint injection,</font>

35
00:01:46,280 --> 00:01:48,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">skin dehydration treatment, and other procedures,</font>

36
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:50,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we can help the skin</font>

37
00:01:50,430 --> 00:01:53,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">look natural, healthy, and radiant...</font>

38
00:01:53,280 --> 00:01:53,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Enough.</font>

39
00:01:54,160 --> 00:01:55,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't throw all those</font>

40
00:01:55,050 --> 00:01:56,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">technical terms at us.</font>

41
00:01:56,760 --> 00:01:57,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">At the end of the day,</font>

42
00:01:57,480 --> 00:01:59,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">aren't you just trying to charge us more?</font>

43
00:02:00,840 --> 00:02:02,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My in-laws aren't highly educated</font>

44
00:02:02,430 --> 00:02:03,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and are easy to fool,</font>

45
00:02:03,350 --> 00:02:04,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but you won't fool me.</font>

46
00:02:05,680 --> 00:02:07,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir, there's no need to be so wary.</font>

47
00:02:07,350 --> 00:02:09,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're a legitimate public institution,</font>

48
00:02:09,150 --> 00:02:09,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">after all.</font>

49
00:02:09,800 --> 00:02:11,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Exorbitant funeral fees are strictly prohibited.</font>

50
00:02:12,120 --> 00:02:12,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our charges</font>

51
00:02:12,680 --> 00:02:14,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are all subject to market regulation.</font>

52
00:02:14,520 --> 00:02:16,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The prices you just saw are all listed here.</font>

53
00:02:20,630 --> 00:02:22,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are all these charges for?</font>

54
00:02:23,590 --> 00:02:25,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everything I just explained</font>

55
00:02:25,360 --> 00:02:27,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">requires an expert-level mortuary technician</font>

56
00:02:27,190 --> 00:02:27,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to perform.</font>

57
00:02:29,310 --> 00:02:29,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look,</font>

58
00:02:30,080 --> 00:02:31,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to be honest,</font>

59
00:02:31,080 --> 00:02:33,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if you were a department head at a hospital,</font>

60
00:02:33,310 --> 00:02:34,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd have</font>

61
00:02:34,280 --> 00:02:35,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">no problem paying</font>

62
00:02:36,190 --> 00:02:36,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">100 times the price</font>

63
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:38,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">as long as it meant saving my wife.</font>

64
00:02:39,520 --> 00:02:40,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But my wife is gone.</font>

65
00:02:40,870 --> 00:02:42,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What good is an expert</font>

66
00:02:42,080 --> 00:02:42,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">at a funeral home now?</font>

67
00:02:44,360 --> 00:02:45,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No offense,</font>

68
00:02:45,520 --> 00:02:46,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but what's the point?</font>

69
00:02:47,240 --> 00:02:49,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even if you do an amazing job,</font>

70
00:02:49,150 --> 00:02:51,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it's not like I'll come back with a thank-you banner,</font>

71
00:02:51,360 --> 00:02:51,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">right?</font>

72
00:02:53,240 --> 00:02:54,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Honestly, in a place like this,</font>

73
00:02:54,710 --> 00:02:56,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't want to spend a cent more than I have to.</font>

74
00:02:58,800 --> 00:02:59,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How about this?</font>

75
00:02:59,910 --> 00:03:00,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll waive</font>

76
00:03:01,240 --> 00:03:02,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">whatever fees we can</font>

77
00:03:02,590 --> 00:03:04,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">under the government's assistance policies.</font>

78
00:03:04,870 --> 00:03:06,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What matters now</font>

79
00:03:06,150 --> 00:03:07,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is whether you accept this plan.</font>

80
00:03:07,710 --> 00:03:08,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you do,</font>

81
00:03:08,430 --> 00:03:09,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we can discuss the details in the office.</font>

82
00:03:23,800 --> 00:03:24,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mao.</font>

83
00:03:24,960 --> 00:03:25,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It didn't go well, huh?</font>

84
00:03:27,000 --> 00:03:27,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I mean,</font>

85
00:03:28,190 --> 00:03:29,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we prepared so carefully</font>

86
00:03:29,030 --> 00:03:30,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and even made a slideshow,</font>

87
00:03:30,280 --> 00:03:31,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and it still didn't work?</font>

88
00:03:32,910 --> 00:03:34,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No matter what,</font>

89
00:03:34,430 --> 00:03:36,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the family's wishes come first.</font>

90
00:03:36,360 --> 00:03:38,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look how understanding our Third Level worker is.</font>

91
00:03:39,150 --> 00:03:40,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, I need to talk to you about something.</font>

92
00:03:40,870 --> 00:03:42,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What is it? We're still working.</font>

93
00:03:42,430 --> 00:03:43,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just say it.</font>

94
00:03:44,560 --> 00:03:45,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Remember my suggestion</font>

95
00:03:46,030 --> 00:03:46,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that we enter</font>

96
00:03:46,630 --> 00:03:48,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the Skills Competition together?</font>

97
00:03:48,840 --> 00:03:50,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's time to submit our application materials.</font>

98
00:03:50,550 --> 00:03:51,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I need yours.</font>

99
00:03:51,870 --> 00:03:54,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's not up to me alone.</font>

100
00:03:54,280 --> 00:03:55,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you ask Mr. Cao for permission?</font>

101
00:04:02,560 --> 00:04:03,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not bad, huh?</font>

102
00:04:04,190 --> 00:04:06,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fang modified it for me from an abandoned bike</font>

103
00:04:06,470 --> 00:04:07,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in our bike shed.</font>

104
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:09,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My gym membership expired,</font>

105
00:04:10,190 --> 00:04:11,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and my wife wouldn't let me renew it.</font>

106
00:04:11,400 --> 00:04:12,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nice.</font>

107
00:04:13,560 --> 00:04:15,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your wife sure knows how to save money.</font>

108
00:04:15,190 --> 00:04:15,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right?</font>

109
00:04:21,190 --> 00:04:21,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir,</font>

110
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:23,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">about what I just told you,</font>

111
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:25,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what do you think?</font>

112
00:04:26,720 --> 00:04:27,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That?</font>

113
00:04:27,830 --> 00:04:28,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I heard you</font>

114
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:29,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">loud and clear.</font>

115
00:04:30,190 --> 00:04:31,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well,</font>

116
00:04:31,160 --> 00:04:32,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how should I put it?</font>

117
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:33,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well,</font>

118
00:04:34,310 --> 00:04:35,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you know...</font>

119
00:04:35,430 --> 00:04:36,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir,</font>

120
00:04:38,560 --> 00:04:39,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">take a break and catch your breath.</font>

121
00:04:40,190 --> 00:04:41,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me replenish my electrolytes.</font>

122
00:04:42,680 --> 00:04:43,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What were you saying again?</font>

123
00:04:47,720 --> 00:04:49,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't you hear me loud and clear?</font>

124
00:04:55,830 --> 00:04:56,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Oh, that.</font>

125
00:04:57,190 --> 00:04:58,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Forming a team</font>

126
00:04:58,800 --> 00:05:00,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for the Skills Competition,</font>

127
00:05:00,040 --> 00:05:00,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">huh?</font>

128
00:05:03,270 --> 00:05:04,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Great idea.</font>

129
00:05:05,720 --> 00:05:06,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">First of all,</font>

130
00:05:06,870 --> 00:05:08,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm glad to see that a newcomer</font>

131
00:05:09,000 --> 00:05:10,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to our mortuary prep team</font>

132
00:05:10,510 --> 00:05:11,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has that kind of initiative.</font>

133
00:05:12,560 --> 00:05:13,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But</font>

134
00:05:14,510 --> 00:05:16,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">as the team leader,</font>

135
00:05:17,750 --> 00:05:18,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm also in a difficult position.</font>

136
00:05:19,950 --> 00:05:20,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You know what I mean?</font>

137
00:05:23,430 --> 00:05:24,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How so?</font>

138
00:05:28,040 --> 00:05:28,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You don't get it?</font>

139
00:05:32,510 --> 00:05:33,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How should I put this?</font>

140
00:05:33,070 --> 00:05:34,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take this bike, for example.</font>

141
00:05:36,270 --> 00:05:36,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I</font>

142
00:05:37,310 --> 00:05:39,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">really want it to go far.</font>

143
00:05:41,310 --> 00:05:42,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But</font>

144
00:05:47,600 --> 00:05:48,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it can't actually go anywhere.</font>

145
00:05:49,720 --> 00:05:50,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get it now?</font>

146
00:05:54,270 --> 00:05:54,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

147
00:05:56,750 --> 00:05:58,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How do you still not get it?</font>

148
00:06:00,830 --> 00:06:01,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me put it this way.</font>

149
00:06:03,160 --> 00:06:04,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I support your idea,</font>

150
00:06:05,270 --> 00:06:07,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but I'm mainly responsible for morale</font>

151
00:06:07,720 --> 00:06:08,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and motivation on our team.</font>

152
00:06:08,950 --> 00:06:10,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For the practical side, you'll need to talk to Dandan,</font>

153
00:06:11,040 --> 00:06:12,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">okay? Go talk to her.</font>

154
00:06:13,190 --> 00:06:14,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've got my support.</font>

155
00:06:18,830 --> 00:06:19,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir,</font>

156
00:06:20,510 --> 00:06:21,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">sometimes</font>

157
00:06:22,190 --> 00:06:23,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you can't go far</font>

158
00:06:23,750 --> 00:06:25,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">because you're stuck on too high a stand.</font>

159
00:06:30,830 --> 00:06:32,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I talked to him. He's fully on board.</font>

160
00:06:32,510 --> 00:06:33,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He said it was great to see</font>

161
00:06:34,120 --> 00:06:35,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">young people with this kind of drive.</font>

162
00:06:37,070 --> 00:06:38,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What about Dandan?</font>

163
00:06:40,870 --> 00:06:41,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

164
00:06:42,070 --> 00:06:43,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you all leave, who's going to help me?</font>

165
00:06:45,070 --> 00:06:46,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me help you, Dandan.</font>

166
00:06:46,070 --> 00:06:46,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There you go.</font>

167
00:06:53,190 --> 00:06:53,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dandan,</font>

168
00:06:54,040 --> 00:06:55,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">here's the thing.</font>

169
00:06:55,510 --> 00:06:57,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's been approved.</font>

170
00:06:57,480 --> 00:06:58,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">By whom?</font>

171
00:06:59,360 --> 00:07:00,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our team leader.</font>

172
00:07:00,630 --> 00:07:02,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His approval means nothing.</font>

173
00:07:02,630 --> 00:07:03,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He doesn't handle the schedule.</font>

174
00:07:04,160 --> 00:07:05,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He always gets to play the good guy.</font>

175
00:07:06,190 --> 00:07:07,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right, I know.</font>

176
00:07:07,270 --> 00:07:08,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've got your concerns.</font>

177
00:07:09,830 --> 00:07:11,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But Mr. Cao</font>

178
00:07:11,750 --> 00:07:13,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">really does support this.</font>

179
00:07:13,190 --> 00:07:15,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Medical Waste Bin]
He said he was delighted</font>

180
00:07:15,190 --> 00:07:16,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to see a newcomer</font>

181
00:07:16,630 --> 00:07:17,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to the team</font>

182
00:07:18,040 --> 00:07:19,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">have this much drive</font>

183
00:07:19,630 --> 00:07:20,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and enthusiasm.</font>

184
00:07:21,270 --> 00:07:21,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure.</font>

185
00:07:22,750 --> 00:07:23,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm also delighted to see</font>

186
00:07:23,750 --> 00:07:25,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">your enthusiasm.</font>

187
00:07:25,830 --> 00:07:26,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But Wang Can,</font>

188
00:07:27,390 --> 00:07:28,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm telling you,</font>

189
00:07:28,630 --> 00:07:29,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">these competitions are pointless.</font>

190
00:07:30,870 --> 00:07:32,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are your professional skills up to par?</font>

191
00:07:33,310 --> 00:07:34,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you looked up</font>

192
00:07:34,950 --> 00:07:36,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">which funeral homes the winning teams</font>

193
00:07:36,310 --> 00:07:37,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">came from in past years?</font>

194
00:07:37,950 --> 00:07:39,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dandan, I did.</font>

195
00:07:39,600 --> 00:07:41,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But think about it. Why should greatness belong only to a chosen few?</font>

196
00:07:41,870 --> 00:07:42,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why can't</font>

197
00:07:42,390 --> 00:07:43,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qingliangshan produce a champion?</font>

198
00:07:44,070 --> 00:07:45,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We already did.</font>

199
00:07:45,510 --> 00:07:46,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't Mr. Cao</font>

200
00:07:46,510 --> 00:07:47,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">earn the top rank back then?</font>

201
00:07:47,630 --> 00:07:48,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And what happened?</font>

202
00:07:48,390 --> 00:07:49,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He still came back to the mortuary prep team.</font>

203
00:07:50,190 --> 00:07:51,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tea with the higher-ups by day,</font>

204
00:07:51,380 --> 00:07:52,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">foot rubs for his wife by night.</font>

205
00:07:52,390 --> 00:07:54,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He doesn't even dare to offend a rookie like you.</font>

206
00:07:54,270 --> 00:07:55,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's why he sent you to me.</font>

207
00:07:56,130 --> 00:07:56,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dandan,</font>

208
00:07:56,510 --> 00:07:57,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">wait.</font>

209
00:07:58,120 --> 00:07:58,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How about this?</font>

210
00:07:59,040 --> 00:08:00,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you say yes,</font>

211
00:08:00,270 --> 00:08:01,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">when I get back, I'll give you foot rubs</font>

212
00:08:01,430 --> 00:08:02,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and buy you drinks.</font>

213
00:08:02,750 --> 00:08:04,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Whatever you want, I'll get it.</font>

214
00:08:04,240 --> 00:08:04,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang Can,</font>

215
00:08:04,530 --> 00:08:05,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">do you not understand plain language?</font>

216
00:08:06,270 --> 00:08:07,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why don't you just admit</font>

217
00:08:07,630 --> 00:08:09,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you want time off to go have fun?</font>

218
00:08:09,190 --> 00:08:09,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is that it?</font>

219
00:08:10,160 --> 00:08:10,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If that's what this is,</font>

220
00:08:10,750 --> 00:08:12,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">fine. I approve.</font>

221
00:08:12,240 --> 00:08:12,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go.</font>

222
00:08:14,040 --> 00:08:14,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dandan!</font>

223
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:16,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is this how you see me?</font>

224
00:08:17,830 --> 00:08:19,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is our team really that pathetic?</font>

225
00:08:19,750 --> 00:08:22,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We've got all these ambitious, driven young people.</font>

226
00:08:22,390 --> 00:08:24,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We can't let our blood go cold just because we spend every day</font>

227
00:08:24,160 --> 00:08:25,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">around cold storage, can we?</font>

228
00:08:30,480 --> 00:08:30,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What?</font>

229
00:08:33,200 --> 00:08:34,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You think I'm cold-blooded?</font>

230
00:08:34,840 --> 00:08:35,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine.</font>

231
00:08:35,510 --> 00:08:36,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you've got what it takes,</font>

232
00:08:37,010 --> 00:08:38,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">find hot-blooded people from our team to go with you.</font>

233
00:08:38,720 --> 00:08:40,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come back with a prize, and I'll buy you a drink.</font>

234
00:08:40,390 --> 00:08:40,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give me that!</font>

235
00:08:43,480 --> 00:08:44,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Anything else?</font>

236
00:08:45,480 --> 00:08:45,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're dismissed.</font>

237
00:08:51,030 --> 00:08:51,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dandan doesn't mind.</font>

238
00:08:51,840 --> 00:08:53,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She told me to pick a date</font>

239
00:08:53,280 --> 00:08:54,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so she could give us the time off.</font>

240
00:08:55,780 --> 00:08:56,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then</font>

241
00:08:57,390 --> 00:08:58,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what about Hexu and Tianshuang?</font>

242
00:08:59,080 --> 00:09:00,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're my best friend.</font>

243
00:09:00,670 --> 00:09:01,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll ask them later.</font>

244
00:09:01,360 --> 00:09:02,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you, taking a census?</font>

245
00:09:02,480 --> 00:09:03,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you have to ask about everyone?</font>

246
00:09:04,120 --> 00:09:06,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm fine</font>

247
00:09:06,030 --> 00:09:06,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">either way.</font>

248
00:09:06,910 --> 00:09:08,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If those two go, I'll go.</font>

249
00:09:08,670 --> 00:09:09,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're definitely going.</font>

250
00:09:09,600 --> 00:09:10,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, then it's settled.</font>

251
00:09:10,910 --> 00:09:12,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Should I make a slideshow?</font>

252
00:09:13,030 --> 00:09:13,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No need.</font>

253
00:09:13,870 --> 00:09:14,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're not there yet.</font>

254
00:09:15,240 --> 00:09:16,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at you. You're exactly</font>

255
00:09:16,600 --> 00:09:17,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the same as you were in school.</font>

256
00:09:17,910 --> 00:09:19,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Still full of passion. Love it.</font>

257
00:09:28,910 --> 00:09:29,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shuang,</font>

258
00:09:29,670 --> 00:09:30,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">busy?</font>

259
00:09:30,750 --> 00:09:31,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just cleaning up.</font>

260
00:09:32,120 --> 00:09:32,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Want some help?</font>

261
00:09:33,720 --> 00:09:34,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're not wearing gloves. I'll do it.</font>

262
00:09:35,840 --> 00:09:36,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

263
00:09:37,630 --> 00:09:38,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">By the way,</font>

264
00:09:39,240 --> 00:09:40,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the cafeteria is serving big baozi again.</font>

265
00:09:40,790 --> 00:09:41,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really?</font>

266
00:09:41,840 --> 00:09:42,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's get some later.</font>

267
00:09:46,480 --> 00:09:48,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So what do you think about the Skills Competition?</font>

268
00:09:50,080 --> 00:09:51,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I really want to go.</font>

269
00:09:51,440 --> 00:09:53,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was so excited when you mentioned it.</font>

270
00:09:53,360 --> 00:09:55,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just didn't want to show it.</font>

271
00:09:55,150 --> 00:09:55,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really?</font>

272
00:09:56,030 --> 00:09:56,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really.</font>

273
00:09:57,030 --> 00:09:58,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We might not place, you know.</font>

274
00:09:58,750 --> 00:10:00,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's fine. It'll be like a group trip.</font>

275
00:10:00,630 --> 00:10:02,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Before you came back, no one ever wanted to go.</font>

276
00:10:02,030 --> 00:10:03,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We could never get enough people.</font>

277
00:10:03,390 --> 00:10:05,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You look like you're glowing right now.</font>

278
00:10:05,790 --> 00:10:07,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All right. I'll definitely get a team together.</font>

279
00:10:07,030 --> 00:10:07,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

280
00:10:14,390 --> 00:10:14,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's wrong?</font>

281
00:10:15,870 --> 00:10:16,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My back hurts.</font>

282
00:10:19,200 --> 00:10:19,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

283
00:10:20,910 --> 00:10:21,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sit down.</font>

284
00:10:21,870 --> 00:10:23,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, don't pull me.</font>

285
00:10:23,670 --> 00:10:24,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll sit down myself.</font>

286
00:10:25,320 --> 00:10:26,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What happened?</font>

287
00:10:27,630 --> 00:10:28,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's an old problem.</font>

288
00:10:29,630 --> 00:10:31,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're just leaving it like this?</font>

289
00:10:31,150 --> 00:10:31,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's fine.</font>

290
00:10:33,390 --> 00:10:34,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come here.</font>

291
00:10:34,150 --> 00:10:35,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- What's wrong? - Her back hurts.</font>

292
00:10:35,870 --> 00:10:37,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your old problem again?</font>

293
00:10:37,750 --> 00:10:38,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just need some rest.</font>

294
00:10:38,670 --> 00:10:39,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This isn't okay.</font>

295
00:10:39,300 --> 00:10:40,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's take her to the hospital</font>

296
00:10:40,660 --> 00:10:41,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and get it checked out.</font>

297
00:10:41,270 --> 00:10:41,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

298
00:10:41,790 --> 00:10:42,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hang in there, Shuang.</font>

299
00:10:42,950 --> 00:10:44,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll get us a ride.</font>

300
00:10:44,600 --> 00:10:45,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

301
00:10:47,270 --> 00:10:47,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can,</font>

302
00:10:47,550 --> 00:10:48,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll take her to the community hospital</font>

303
00:10:48,550 --> 00:10:49,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">right across the street.</font>

304
00:11:08,400 --> 00:11:09,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Whoa.</font>

305
00:11:13,550 --> 00:11:14,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Does this hurt?</font>

306
00:11:14,510 --> 00:11:15,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

307
00:11:16,150 --> 00:11:16,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How about here?</font>

308
00:11:16,870 --> 00:11:17,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That hurts too.</font>

309
00:11:17,870 --> 00:11:18,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's frostbite.</font>

310
00:11:19,270 --> 00:11:20,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Around your lower back,</font>

311
00:11:21,000 --> 00:11:22,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">right along the erector spinae muscles,</font>

312
00:11:23,600 --> 00:11:24,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">there's extensive subcutaneous frostbite.</font>

313
00:11:25,200 --> 00:11:26,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's red, swollen, and bruised.</font>

314
00:11:26,480 --> 00:11:27,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You didn't notice?</font>

315
00:11:27,480 --> 00:11:29,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't exactly see my own back, Doctor.</font>

316
00:11:30,030 --> 00:11:31,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All right. Get up.</font>

317
00:11:33,670 --> 00:11:34,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's the hottest time of summer.</font>

318
00:11:35,510 --> 00:11:36,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">With Fushan this warm,</font>

319
00:11:37,240 --> 00:11:38,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how did you get frostbite?</font>

320
00:11:39,240 --> 00:11:40,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you do?</font>

321
00:11:43,510 --> 00:11:44,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're a "neighbor"?</font>

322
00:11:51,790 --> 00:11:53,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you work around cold-storage units a lot?</font>

323
00:11:53,630 --> 00:11:54,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

324
00:11:55,120 --> 00:11:57,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sometimes I also have to move bodies that haven't thawed.</font>

325
00:11:58,480 --> 00:11:59,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I see.</font>

326
00:11:59,670 --> 00:12:01,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But have you been working in an awkward posture?</font>

327
00:12:02,440 --> 00:12:04,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your lower back is badly strained.</font>

328
00:12:06,480 --> 00:12:08,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sometimes I have to dress elderly decedents.</font>

329
00:12:08,510 --> 00:12:10,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Some of them have</font>

330
00:12:10,600 --> 00:12:11,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">severe bedsores,</font>

331
00:12:11,910 --> 00:12:13,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so I have to disinfect and treat them.</font>

332
00:12:13,910 --> 00:12:15,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They can appear under the chin and on the back.</font>

333
00:12:15,960 --> 00:12:18,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't have them lie flat on their back or stomach.</font>

334
00:12:18,440 --> 00:12:19,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Otherwise, the areas I've treated</font>

335
00:12:19,910 --> 00:12:21,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">could get damaged again.</font>

336
00:12:21,200 --> 00:12:22,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The best position is on their side.</font>

337
00:12:22,960 --> 00:12:23,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So I</font>

338
00:12:23,840 --> 00:12:25,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">use my lower back to support them...</font>

339
00:12:25,270 --> 00:12:25,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I understand.</font>

340
00:12:26,270 --> 00:12:27,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sit down first.</font>

341
00:12:27,630 --> 00:12:28,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't move around anymore.</font>

342
00:12:29,150 --> 00:12:29,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

343
00:12:30,960 --> 00:12:32,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This injury has been there for a while.</font>

344
00:12:32,790 --> 00:12:33,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It must hurt a lot.</font>

345
00:12:34,480 --> 00:12:35,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Usually it's manageable.</font>

346
00:12:36,120 --> 00:12:38,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I just couldn't take it today.</font>

347
00:12:39,150 --> 00:12:40,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You really need to be careful from now on.</font>

348
00:12:40,670 --> 00:12:41,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If this keeps up,</font>

349
00:12:41,790 --> 00:12:43,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">your lower back and abdomen will both be affected.</font>

350
00:12:44,150 --> 00:12:46,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your periods could become very painful,</font>

351
00:12:46,960 --> 00:12:48,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and it could also cause gynecological problems.</font>

352
00:12:49,550 --> 00:12:50,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Also,</font>

353
00:12:50,480 --> 00:12:52,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">do you work underground a lot?</font>

354
00:12:53,550 --> 00:12:54,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take more calcium</font>

355
00:12:55,200 --> 00:12:56,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and try to get more sunlight.</font>

356
00:13:00,840 --> 00:13:02,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Otherwise, you could develop osteoporosis</font>

357
00:13:02,670 --> 00:13:04,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and possibly problems with your lumbar spine.</font>

358
00:13:05,150 --> 00:13:05,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Understand?</font>

359
00:13:06,120 --> 00:13:06,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

360
00:13:17,030 --> 00:13:19,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Aren't there any guys at your workplace</font>

361
00:13:19,790 --> 00:13:21,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who can help with all the heavy lifting?</font>

362
00:13:24,480 --> 00:13:25,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There are guys right here.</font>

363
00:13:26,150 --> 00:13:28,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You two handle the heavy work from now on.</font>

364
00:13:31,030 --> 00:13:33,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If something hurts or you're tired, say so.</font>

365
00:13:33,720 --> 00:13:34,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't just suffer in silence.</font>

366
00:13:37,030 --> 00:13:37,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Got it, Doctor.</font>

367
00:13:38,440 --> 00:13:39,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll get going, then.</font>

368
00:13:39,630 --> 00:13:40,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you, Doctor.</font>

369
00:13:40,390 --> 00:13:41,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you.</font>

370
00:13:42,390 --> 00:13:42,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How is it?</font>

371
00:13:43,670 --> 00:13:44,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm fine.</font>

372
00:13:44,790 --> 00:13:45,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's nothing serious.</font>

373
00:14:04,360 --> 00:14:05,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hexu, slow down. Don't fall.</font>

374
00:14:07,200 --> 00:14:08,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You know, being away from the city</font>

375
00:14:09,440 --> 00:14:10,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">really does mean cleaner air.</font>

376
00:14:22,630 --> 00:14:24,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll beat you up if you fall asleep again!</font>

377
00:14:24,600 --> 00:14:24,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get up!</font>

378
00:14:24,910 --> 00:14:25,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir.</font>

379
00:14:26,720 --> 00:14:27,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ms. Chen.</font>

380
00:14:27,910 --> 00:14:29,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks for coming all this way.</font>

381
00:14:29,390 --> 00:14:30,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Normally, I wouldn't need you here,</font>

382
00:14:30,750 --> 00:14:33,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but the family wants a full-scale ceremony.</font>

383
00:14:33,120 --> 00:14:35,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There are ushers, musicians, the ritual altar,</font>

384
00:14:35,790 --> 00:14:36,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and I can't handle all of it alone.</font>

385
00:14:36,630 --> 00:14:37,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks for the help.</font>

386
00:14:37,390 --> 00:14:38,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No problem.</font>

387
00:14:38,200 --> 00:14:39,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me confirm with you.</font>

388
00:14:39,480 --> 00:14:40,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The family requested</font>

389
00:14:40,750 --> 00:14:42,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">basic surface embalming.</font>

390
00:14:42,480 --> 00:14:43,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But they need dressing and makeup too, right?</font>

391
00:14:44,510 --> 00:14:45,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Young man,</font>

392
00:14:46,120 --> 00:14:47,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we meet again.</font>

393
00:14:47,440 --> 00:14:48,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We've met three times in one week,</font>

394
00:14:48,480 --> 00:14:49,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and every time,</font>

395
00:14:50,080 --> 00:14:51,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- everything went smoothly.
- Do we have a refrigerated coffin?</font>

396
00:14:52,390 --> 00:14:52,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A refrigerated coffin.</font>

397
00:14:53,840 --> 00:14:54,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

398
00:14:54,750 --> 00:14:58,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We got it from a funeral supply shop in the countryside.</font>

399
00:14:58,390 --> 00:15:00,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But as you can see, the quality...</font>

400
00:15:00,120 --> 00:15:00,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's okay.</font>

401
00:15:00,870 --> 00:15:02,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It'll be much better once we've embalmed her.</font>

402
00:15:02,270 --> 00:15:02,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Right. - Embalmed...?</font>

403
00:15:03,000 --> 00:15:04,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We brought professional equipment.</font>

404
00:15:05,120 --> 00:15:05,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Professional.</font>

405
00:15:06,440 --> 00:15:06,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Very professional.</font>

406
00:15:08,080 --> 00:15:08,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me take a look.</font>

407
00:15:13,270 --> 00:15:13,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Listen.</font>

408
00:15:14,080 --> 00:15:16,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've noticed something about you two.</font>

409
00:15:18,390 --> 00:15:19,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can tell?</font>

410
00:15:20,510 --> 00:15:21,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can read the living too?</font>

411
00:15:22,510 --> 00:15:25,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fate, romance, love prospects...</font>

412
00:15:25,960 --> 00:15:26,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can read it all.</font>

413
00:15:26,750 --> 00:15:27,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The deceased is right here.</font>

414
00:15:28,200 --> 00:15:29,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll talk about it later.</font>

415
00:15:29,750 --> 00:15:31,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir, can we get to work?</font>

416
00:15:32,960 --> 00:15:34,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure.</font>

417
00:15:34,750 --> 00:15:35,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's get to work.</font>

418
00:15:35,200 --> 00:15:36,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When I start embalming,</font>

419
00:15:36,150 --> 00:15:37,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">don't let any family members come in.</font>

420
00:15:39,600 --> 00:15:41,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even professionals like you</font>

421
00:15:41,510 --> 00:15:42,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">have to keep people out?</font>

422
00:15:43,200 --> 00:15:44,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We have to use needles.</font>

423
00:15:44,390 --> 00:15:45,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The family might find it upsetting.</font>

424
00:15:47,120 --> 00:15:47,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Makes sense.</font>

425
00:15:48,120 --> 00:15:49,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll leave you to it.</font>

426
00:15:49,150 --> 00:15:49,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

427
00:15:50,840 --> 00:15:51,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang Can.</font>

428
00:15:52,030 --> 00:15:52,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get to work.</font>

429
00:15:53,510 --> 00:15:54,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll leave you to it.</font>

430
00:16:05,870 --> 00:16:07,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're really good at embalming now.</font>

431
00:16:07,630 --> 00:16:08,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Impressive, Hexu.</font>

432
00:16:09,200 --> 00:16:10,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't get me started.</font>

433
00:16:10,390 --> 00:16:11,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is normally Mao Erzhe's job.</font>

434
00:16:13,080 --> 00:16:13,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I swapped duties with him</font>

435
00:16:13,840 --> 00:16:15,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so I could learn more from you.</font>

436
00:16:17,270 --> 00:16:17,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">By the way,</font>

437
00:16:18,320 --> 00:16:19,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">about the Skills Competition,</font>

438
00:16:19,960 --> 00:16:21,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are you on board?</font>

439
00:16:22,390 --> 00:16:22,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll pass.</font>

440
00:16:23,910 --> 00:16:24,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But if we place,</font>

441
00:16:24,870 --> 00:16:25,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the prize money's pretty good.</font>

442
00:16:27,510 --> 00:16:29,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I eat what I can afford and earn what I can.</font>

443
00:16:29,510 --> 00:16:30,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not like you.</font>

444
00:16:30,240 --> 00:16:31,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're never satisfied with what you've got.</font>

445
00:16:38,630 --> 00:16:39,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sweetheart, are you okay?</font>

446
00:16:39,910 --> 00:16:40,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

447
00:16:42,000 --> 00:16:43,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're doomed! She touched you!</font>

448
00:16:43,750 --> 00:16:45,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're going to see ghosts!</font>

449
00:16:45,480 --> 00:16:46,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're turning into a witch!</font>

450
00:16:46,480 --> 00:16:47,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hey!</font>

451
00:16:47,320 --> 00:16:49,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The dead are coming for you!</font>

452
00:16:50,720 --> 00:16:52,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't cry. You're okay.</font>

453
00:16:52,030 --> 00:16:52,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ignore them.</font>

454
00:16:53,080 --> 00:16:54,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm working inside.</font>

455
00:16:54,120 --> 00:16:55,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you wait outside for a bit?</font>

456
00:16:58,080 --> 00:16:59,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Great-Grandma is sleeping.</font>

457
00:17:00,150 --> 00:17:01,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please be quiet.</font>

458
00:17:01,360 --> 00:17:02,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't wake her up.</font>

459
00:17:03,630 --> 00:17:04,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

460
00:17:04,350 --> 00:17:05,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll be quiet.</font>

461
00:17:16,030 --> 00:17:17,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hexu, what are you...?</font>

462
00:17:27,030 --> 00:17:27,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Make it louder later.</font>

463
00:17:27,960 --> 00:17:28,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dan!</font>

464
00:17:28,510 --> 00:17:28,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

465
00:17:29,000 --> 00:17:29,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dan.</font>

466
00:17:29,350 --> 00:17:29,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Master.</font>

467
00:17:30,240 --> 00:17:30,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How's the sound system?</font>

468
00:17:31,070 --> 00:17:32,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- All good. - All good?</font>

469
00:17:32,030 --> 00:17:32,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All good.</font>

470
00:17:32,960 --> 00:17:33,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where's the singer?</font>

471
00:17:33,510 --> 00:17:33,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right here.</font>

472
00:17:33,880 --> 00:17:34,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- There. - I see.</font>

473
00:17:35,350 --> 00:17:36,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Turn it up.</font>

474
00:17:36,720 --> 00:17:37,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

475
00:17:37,030 --> 00:17:38,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Liven things up.</font>

476
00:17:38,030 --> 00:17:38,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- You got it. - Okay?</font>

477
00:17:38,810 --> 00:17:40,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Okay. - Three, two, one, go!</font>

478
00:17:51,680 --> 00:17:53,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Watch closely.</font>

479
00:17:57,750 --> 00:17:59,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hexu, we need to hurry.</font>

480
00:17:59,920 --> 00:18:00,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It should be starting soon.</font>

481
00:18:02,830 --> 00:18:03,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Something's not right.</font>

482
00:18:04,160 --> 00:18:05,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's wrong?</font>

483
00:18:06,720 --> 00:18:08,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In her photo,</font>

484
00:18:08,550 --> 00:18:09,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">her mouth looks nice and full.</font>

485
00:18:11,400 --> 00:18:13,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But now it looks a little sunken.</font>

486
00:18:14,510 --> 00:18:16,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think she wore dentures when she was alive.</font>

487
00:18:16,830 --> 00:18:18,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But we didn't prepare any dentures.</font>

488
00:18:18,350 --> 00:18:19,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll ask the family.</font>

489
00:18:26,510 --> 00:18:27,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Excuse me.</font>

490
00:18:27,590 --> 00:18:28,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes?</font>

491
00:18:30,790 --> 00:18:31,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Zhao Weimin?</font>

492
00:18:33,790 --> 00:18:34,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chen Hexu?</font>

493
00:18:37,350 --> 00:18:37,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang Can?</font>

494
00:18:38,440 --> 00:18:39,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're in this line of work too?</font>

495
00:18:40,240 --> 00:18:41,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's me, Zhao Weimin.</font>

496
00:18:41,350 --> 00:18:41,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">From the Social Welfare Department.</font>

497
00:18:41,920 --> 00:18:42,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I remember.</font>

498
00:18:42,640 --> 00:18:43,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shao Yi's classmate, right?</font>

499
00:18:44,590 --> 00:18:45,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right.</font>

500
00:18:45,440 --> 00:18:46,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[In Memoriam]
My condolences.</font>

501
00:18:46,270 --> 00:18:46,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My condolences.</font>

502
00:18:46,960 --> 00:18:48,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dad, we went to college together.</font>

503
00:18:49,510 --> 00:18:50,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did your grandma wear dentures?</font>

504
00:18:51,440 --> 00:18:52,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you mean?</font>

505
00:18:53,070 --> 00:18:54,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If she did,</font>

506
00:18:54,510 --> 00:18:55,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it's best to put them in.</font>

507
00:18:55,750 --> 00:18:57,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That'll make her face look fuller,</font>

508
00:18:57,240 --> 00:18:58,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and she'll look much better after makeup.</font>

509
00:18:59,680 --> 00:19:00,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dad,</font>

510
00:19:00,270 --> 00:19:01,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">do we still have Grandma's dentures?</font>

511
00:19:02,000 --> 00:19:03,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We do, but none of us</font>

512
00:19:03,830 --> 00:19:04,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">know how to put them in.</font>

513
00:19:05,480 --> 00:19:07,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She always did it herself.</font>

514
00:19:08,550 --> 00:19:09,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know how.</font>

515
00:19:09,830 --> 00:19:11,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you have them, we should put them in</font>

516
00:19:11,350 --> 00:19:13,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so she can look her best when she goes.</font>

517
00:19:14,240 --> 00:19:16,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're willing to put in Grandma's dentures?</font>

518
00:19:16,350 --> 00:19:17,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Of course.</font>

519
00:19:17,110 --> 00:19:18,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's part of our job.</font>

520
00:19:20,750 --> 00:19:21,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

521
00:19:21,880 --> 00:19:22,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll go look for them.</font>

522
00:19:22,880 --> 00:19:23,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll come with you.</font>

523
00:19:23,790 --> 00:19:24,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay. This way.</font>

524
00:19:28,070 --> 00:19:29,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just one thing.</font>

525
00:19:29,110 --> 00:19:30,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once they're finished,</font>

526
00:19:30,200 --> 00:19:31,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we can begin.</font>

527
00:19:31,440 --> 00:19:31,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Zhou,</font>

528
00:19:32,640 --> 00:19:33,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">can I have a word?</font>

529
00:19:34,960 --> 00:19:35,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What is it?</font>

530
00:19:36,270 --> 00:19:37,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We didn't finish our conversation.</font>

531
00:19:39,270 --> 00:19:40,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">About Ms. Chen and me...</font>

532
00:19:41,440 --> 00:19:42,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You have a shot.</font>

533
00:19:44,310 --> 00:19:45,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's what you wanted to ask?</font>

534
00:19:45,590 --> 00:19:46,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Young man,</font>

535
00:19:46,550 --> 00:19:47,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you and I were meant to meet.</font>

536
00:19:48,000 --> 00:19:48,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me tell you,</font>

537
00:19:49,720 --> 00:19:51,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">your love life is blocked</font>

538
00:19:51,350 --> 00:19:53,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">because your career path is blocked.</font>

539
00:19:55,400 --> 00:19:58,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once your career path is clear, everything will work out.</font>

540
00:19:58,510 --> 00:19:59,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Makes sense, right?</font>

541
00:19:59,480 --> 00:20:00,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It does.</font>

542
00:20:00,790 --> 00:20:02,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So how do I clear my career path?</font>

543
00:20:02,480 --> 00:20:04,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This job of yours has plenty of prospects.</font>

544
00:20:07,070 --> 00:20:09,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've got the funeral home's resources,</font>

545
00:20:09,720 --> 00:20:11,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and I've got skills passed down through generations.</font>

546
00:20:12,310 --> 00:20:13,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We can work together.</font>

547
00:20:14,750 --> 00:20:15,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then</font>

548
00:20:15,920 --> 00:20:16,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">business</font>

549
00:20:17,270 --> 00:20:19,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">will definitely be much better than it is now.</font>

550
00:20:19,590 --> 00:20:21,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll split the income fifty-fifty.</font>

551
00:20:21,510 --> 00:20:23,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once your career takes off, your love life will too.</font>

552
00:20:23,550 --> 00:20:24,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm afraid your career will take off</font>

553
00:20:24,960 --> 00:20:25,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">before I get my shot at love.</font>

554
00:20:30,440 --> 00:20:31,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This path is blocked.</font>

555
00:20:55,200 --> 00:20:55,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Doesn't she</font>

556
00:20:56,030 --> 00:20:57,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">look much younger now?</font>

557
00:20:58,110 --> 00:20:58,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

558
00:21:00,000 --> 00:21:01,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She looks just like the photo.</font>

559
00:21:02,350 --> 00:21:03,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Pass me the lipstick. I'll touch it up a little.</font>

560
00:21:06,960 --> 00:21:07,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go get the family.</font>

561
00:21:07,830 --> 00:21:08,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're almost done here.</font>

562
00:21:08,920 --> 00:21:09,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

563
00:21:48,590 --> 00:21:49,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Grandma.</font>

564
00:21:52,750 --> 00:21:54,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I came back too late.</font>

565
00:22:15,400 --> 00:22:16,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you.</font>

566
00:22:51,310 --> 00:22:51,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Help yourselves.</font>

567
00:22:52,160 --> 00:22:52,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't be shy.</font>

568
00:22:53,960 --> 00:22:54,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Old friends.</font>

569
00:22:55,750 --> 00:22:56,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Zhao.</font>

570
00:22:56,110 --> 00:22:57,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're off work, so you can drink, right?</font>

571
00:22:57,440 --> 00:22:58,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure.</font>

572
00:22:58,110 --> 00:22:58,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

573
00:22:59,030 --> 00:23:00,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I really didn't expect to see you today.</font>

574
00:23:00,960 --> 00:23:01,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My condolences.</font>

575
00:23:02,400 --> 00:23:02,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My condolences.</font>

576
00:23:03,640 --> 00:23:05,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My grandma lived to a ripe old age.</font>

577
00:23:05,270 --> 00:23:06,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You could call it a joyous funeral.</font>

578
00:23:06,880 --> 00:23:08,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks for your help today.</font>

579
00:23:09,310 --> 00:23:09,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's our job.</font>

580
00:23:11,000 --> 00:23:11,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Back in college,</font>

581
00:23:12,640 --> 00:23:14,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we weren't very friendly to you guys in the Funeral Services Department.</font>

582
00:23:15,200 --> 00:23:16,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We even looked down on you.</font>

583
00:23:16,640 --> 00:23:17,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But honestly,</font>

584
00:23:18,070 --> 00:23:19,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">today, here in our village,</font>

585
00:23:19,720 --> 00:23:21,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">by our customs,</font>

586
00:23:21,920 --> 00:23:24,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you two are honored professionals. You're held in very high regard.</font>

587
00:23:25,400 --> 00:23:27,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So all that discrimination out there</font>

588
00:23:27,590 --> 00:23:28,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">really shouldn't happen.</font>

589
00:23:28,920 --> 00:23:30,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What did that banner</font>

590
00:23:30,310 --> 00:23:31,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you had hanging on the campus wall say?</font>

591
00:23:32,720 --> 00:23:35,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">"All things share one dwelling; life and death are one."</font>

592
00:23:36,110 --> 00:23:36,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In the end,</font>

593
00:23:37,160 --> 00:23:39,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we all go to the same place.</font>

594
00:23:39,480 --> 00:23:40,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Exactly.</font>

595
00:23:41,400 --> 00:23:43,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You practice modern funeral services,</font>

596
00:23:43,310 --> 00:23:44,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and I preserve tradition.</font>

597
00:23:44,880 --> 00:23:47,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yet here we are, eating at the same table.</font>

598
00:23:47,270 --> 00:23:48,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Should you be at this table, though?</font>

599
00:23:49,510 --> 00:23:50,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So really,</font>

600
00:23:50,590 --> 00:23:52,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">life is pretty short.</font>

601
00:23:53,270 --> 00:23:53,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just</font>

602
00:23:54,160 --> 00:23:56,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">make more friends and make more money,</font>

603
00:23:56,400 --> 00:23:56,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">right?</font>

604
00:23:58,000 --> 00:24:00,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When the money path opens, every path opens.</font>

605
00:24:00,310 --> 00:24:01,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And your love life...</font>

606
00:24:01,480 --> 00:24:02,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All right, enough!</font>

607
00:24:02,640 --> 00:24:03,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Keep your master in check.</font>

608
00:24:03,480 --> 00:24:03,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Back to your table.</font>

609
00:24:04,200 --> 00:24:05,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Think about it.</font>

610
00:24:06,160 --> 00:24:06,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, eat.</font>

611
00:24:06,920 --> 00:24:07,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

612
00:24:07,440 --> 00:24:07,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Try this.</font>

613
00:24:07,920 --> 00:24:08,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You eat too.</font>

614
00:24:08,960 --> 00:24:09,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

615
00:24:10,790 --> 00:24:11,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">These river snails are really flavorful.</font>

616
00:24:12,200 --> 00:24:13,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah. They've soaked up all the flavor.</font>

617
00:24:15,830 --> 00:24:16,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Guess who's calling?</font>

618
00:24:17,720 --> 00:24:18,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mao Erzhe.</font>

619
00:24:18,460 --> 00:24:19,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Mao Erzhe]</font>

620
00:24:19,030 --> 00:24:20,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I remember him. The Watermelon Warrior</font>

621
00:24:21,440 --> 00:24:22,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">from your department.</font>

622
00:24:23,200 --> 00:24:24,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You guys are still in touch?</font>

623
00:24:24,640 --> 00:24:25,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're coworkers now.</font>

624
00:24:26,270 --> 00:24:27,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's something. Really something.</font>

625
00:24:28,960 --> 00:24:29,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mao Erzhe.</font>

626
00:24:29,790 --> 00:24:30,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello, Can.</font>

627
00:24:31,590 --> 00:24:33,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How's it going over there?</font>

628
00:24:33,640 --> 00:24:34,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're</font>

629
00:24:35,110 --> 00:24:37,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a perfect team. Totally in sync.</font>

630
00:24:38,920 --> 00:24:39,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

631
00:24:39,590 --> 00:24:40,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where's Hexu?</font>

632
00:24:40,400 --> 00:24:41,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me talk to her.</font>

633
00:24:41,880 --> 00:24:42,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm right here.</font>

634
00:24:44,110 --> 00:24:44,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's up?</font>

635
00:24:45,590 --> 00:24:46,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nothing.</font>

636
00:24:46,750 --> 00:24:49,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just checking how things are going.</font>

637
00:24:49,750 --> 00:24:51,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't hear you. I'm busy.</font>

638
00:24:51,400 --> 00:24:52,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll talk when we get back.</font>

639
00:24:53,070 --> 00:24:53,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, talk later.</font>

640
00:24:53,960 --> 00:24:54,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hexu and I are busy right now.</font>

641
00:24:54,960 --> 00:24:55,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm hanging up.</font>

642
00:24:58,480 --> 00:24:59,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is everything</font>

643
00:24:59,240 --> 00:25:00,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">okay over there?</font>

644
00:25:02,030 --> 00:25:03,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was really noisy over there.</font>

645
00:25:03,720 --> 00:25:05,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I could barely hear them.</font>

646
00:25:05,270 --> 00:25:06,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All I heard was slurping.</font>

647
00:25:07,350 --> 00:25:08,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sounded like they were making out.</font>

648
00:25:08,880 --> 00:25:09,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What?</font>

649
00:25:16,260 --> 00:25:20,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Funeral Hall]</font>

650
00:25:27,960 --> 00:25:28,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

651
00:25:29,400 --> 00:25:30,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What is this?</font>

652
00:25:31,480 --> 00:25:32,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's from Weimin.</font>

653
00:25:32,240 --> 00:25:32,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He said it was homemade.</font>

654
00:25:33,200 --> 00:25:33,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He wanted us to try it.</font>

655
00:25:39,110 --> 00:25:40,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's up, sweetheart?</font>

656
00:25:40,590 --> 00:25:42,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Great-Grandma has gone to find Great-Grandpa.</font>

657
00:25:44,070 --> 00:25:44,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

658
00:25:45,200 --> 00:25:46,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're together again in the other world.</font>

659
00:25:47,790 --> 00:25:48,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss,</font>

660
00:25:48,550 --> 00:25:50,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you're like the Fairy Godmother in Cinderella.</font>

661
00:25:50,790 --> 00:25:52,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You dressed Cinderella up</font>

662
00:25:52,550 --> 00:25:53,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and sent her off to the ball.</font>

663
00:25:54,270 --> 00:25:55,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're not a witch.</font>

664
00:26:02,110 --> 00:26:02,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you.</font>

665
00:26:08,580 --> 00:26:13,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[In Memoriam, In Loving Memory]</font>

666
00:26:58,720 --> 00:27:00,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why is Liu still not back?</font>

667
00:27:00,640 --> 00:27:01,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How long does it take to get gas?</font>

668
00:27:08,030 --> 00:27:08,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at you, enjoying yourself.</font>

669
00:27:10,110 --> 00:27:10,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's pretty good.</font>

670
00:27:11,310 --> 00:27:11,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Try some.</font>

671
00:27:15,160 --> 00:27:15,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you smiling at?</font>

672
00:27:17,880 --> 00:27:18,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm happy.</font>

673
00:27:19,160 --> 00:27:20,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's there to be happy about?</font>

674
00:27:20,830 --> 00:27:23,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm happy that at 25, Chen Hexu has finally</font>

675
00:27:23,110 --> 00:27:24,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">learned to smile again.</font>

676
00:27:24,350 --> 00:27:25,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've always known how to smile.</font>

677
00:27:25,590 --> 00:27:26,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just don't like smiling at you.</font>

678
00:27:28,960 --> 00:27:30,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You just don't smile at the living.</font>

679
00:27:31,160 --> 00:27:31,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is that right?</font>

680
00:27:32,480 --> 00:27:33,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you trying to say?</font>

681
00:27:35,110 --> 00:27:35,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Never mind.</font>

682
00:27:36,750 --> 00:27:37,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You'll just get mad again.</font>

683
00:27:39,350 --> 00:27:40,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Say it.</font>

684
00:27:40,790 --> 00:27:42,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's see how you're going to make me mad.</font>

685
00:27:43,880 --> 00:27:44,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You asked for it.</font>

686
00:27:46,640 --> 00:27:48,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You think I've needed you guys a lot</font>

687
00:27:49,240 --> 00:27:50,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">since I came back, don't you?</font>

688
00:27:52,000 --> 00:27:55,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But actually, you guys need me just as much.</font>

689
00:27:56,510 --> 00:27:57,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ever since I came back,</font>

690
00:27:57,200 --> 00:27:58,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">hasn't everyone been happier?</font>

691
00:27:58,640 --> 00:27:59,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even you've learned to smile.</font>

692
00:28:00,880 --> 00:28:02,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">With weather this nice,</font>

693
00:28:02,110 --> 00:28:02,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">scenery this beautiful,</font>

694
00:28:02,880 --> 00:28:04,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and us still this young,</font>

695
00:28:04,350 --> 00:28:05,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we should smile more.</font>

696
00:28:05,790 --> 00:28:06,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Especially you.</font>

697
00:28:07,000 --> 00:28:08,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You need to act more like you're alive.</font>

698
00:28:08,880 --> 00:28:09,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You used to be</font>

699
00:28:10,350 --> 00:28:11,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">like some stone-faced AI.</font>

700
00:28:12,550 --> 00:28:14,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you one of the living dead?</font>

701
00:28:14,440 --> 00:28:15,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing?</font>

702
00:28:15,030 --> 00:28:16,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who are you calling stone-faced?</font>

703
00:28:17,350 --> 00:28:18,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't come over here!</font>

704
00:28:18,160 --> 00:28:19,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's not stable.</font>

705
00:28:19,400 --> 00:28:20,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was trying to heal you!</font>

706
00:28:20,920 --> 00:28:21,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Heal me from what?</font>

707
00:28:21,680 --> 00:28:22,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're the one who needs fixing.</font>

708
00:28:23,000 --> 00:28:24,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And don't get all paternalistic on me.</font>

709
00:28:24,160 --> 00:28:25,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't need another dad in my life.</font>

710
00:28:26,590 --> 00:28:28,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just want to see you smile, okay?</font>

711
00:28:37,300 --> 00:28:40,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I gently tuck every word away♪</font>

712
00:28:40,340 --> 00:28:46,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I walk beside you, taking it slow♪</font>

713
00:28:47,740 --> 00:28:54,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪My thoughts stretch long like tree shadows♪</font>

714
00:28:55,980 --> 00:28:59,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Could she be riding on the wind♪</font>

715
00:28:59,180 --> 00:29:02,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Flying back to the place she loved most♪</font>

716
00:29:02,500 --> 00:29:05,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Like a bag filled with longing♪</font>

717
00:29:06,100 --> 00:29:08,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Drifting past the old windowsill?♪</font>

718
00:29:08,750 --> 00:29:09,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hexu,</font>

719
00:29:11,030 --> 00:29:12,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">look at that plastic bag.</font>

720
00:29:12,440 --> 00:29:13,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't it flying</font>

721
00:29:13,880 --> 00:29:14,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">toward the decedent's place?</font>

722
00:29:16,640 --> 00:29:17,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you think her soul</font>

723
00:29:17,880 --> 00:29:19,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is inside that plastic bag?</font>

724
00:29:26,000 --> 00:29:27,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Maybe she has something</font>

725
00:29:27,350 --> 00:29:28,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she wants to hold on to.</font>

726
00:29:34,750 --> 00:29:35,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang Can!</font>

727
00:29:35,960 --> 00:29:36,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you okay?</font>

728
00:29:55,000 --> 00:29:56,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That outfit actually goes well with your complexion.</font>

729
00:29:56,680 --> 00:29:57,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You want one too?</font>

730
00:30:01,640 --> 00:30:02,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Open the door!</font>

731
00:30:03,000 --> 00:30:04,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Be grateful.</font>

732
00:30:04,640 --> 00:30:06,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're lucky I found you something to wear.</font>

733
00:30:06,350 --> 00:30:07,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry up.</font>

734
00:30:09,030 --> 00:30:10,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Back to the funeral home or your place?</font>

735
00:30:10,160 --> 00:30:10,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My place.</font>

736
00:30:10,680 --> 00:30:11,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't have any clothes to change into at work.</font>

737
00:30:12,640 --> 00:30:12,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I...</font>

738
00:30:13,460 --> 00:30:14,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm worried your parents</font>

739
00:30:14,310 --> 00:30:15,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">will beat you up when they see you in that.</font>

740
00:30:15,850 --> 00:30:17,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My parents aren't home.</font>

741
00:30:17,240 --> 00:30:18,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What if they are?</font>

742
00:30:18,590 --> 00:30:19,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're really not.</font>

743
00:30:19,310 --> 00:30:20,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please, Hexu, just let me in.</font>

744
00:30:20,790 --> 00:30:22,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can beat me up if you want, okay?</font>

745
00:30:23,310 --> 00:30:23,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine.</font>

746
00:30:39,920 --> 00:30:40,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks, Liu.</font>

747
00:30:41,200 --> 00:30:41,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chen Hexu,</font>

748
00:30:42,110 --> 00:30:43,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang Can left his clothes here.</font>

749
00:30:43,590 --> 00:30:44,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You live close to him.</font>

750
00:30:44,750 --> 00:30:45,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Could you take them over?</font>

751
00:30:45,830 --> 00:30:47,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't park in this alley.</font>

752
00:30:47,750 --> 00:30:48,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks.</font>

753
00:30:48,590 --> 00:30:49,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bye.</font>

754
00:31:00,240 --> 00:31:00,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dad?</font>

755
00:31:04,360 --> 00:31:04,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mom?</font>

756
00:31:07,240 --> 00:31:08,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm home!</font>

757
00:31:21,880 --> 00:31:24,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Getting four people together isn't easy.</font>

758
00:31:24,590 --> 00:31:25,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Son, you're back?</font>

759
00:31:26,080 --> 00:31:26,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come in.</font>

760
00:31:35,960 --> 00:31:36,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's okay.</font>

761
00:31:36,640 --> 00:31:37,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on in.</font>

762
00:31:37,310 --> 00:31:38,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, have a seat.</font>

763
00:31:40,480 --> 00:31:41,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come in. Sit down.</font>

764
00:31:41,640 --> 00:31:43,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everybody, sit.</font>

765
00:31:43,070 --> 00:31:44,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at this brat.</font>

766
00:31:45,000 --> 00:31:46,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So mischievous.</font>

767
00:31:46,400 --> 00:31:47,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's been like this</font>

768
00:31:47,720 --> 00:31:49,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">since he was little, always playing tricks on us.</font>

769
00:31:49,790 --> 00:31:51,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, have a seat.</font>

770
00:31:51,110 --> 00:31:51,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here, sit.</font>

771
00:31:51,750 --> 00:31:52,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's just play.</font>

772
00:31:53,270 --> 00:31:54,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you standing there for?</font>

773
00:31:54,720 --> 00:31:55,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's so hot.</font>

774
00:31:55,720 --> 00:31:57,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take that outfit off.</font>

775
00:31:57,110 --> 00:31:58,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm fine, Mom.</font>

776
00:31:58,110 --> 00:31:58,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really, I'm fine.</font>

777
00:31:58,960 --> 00:31:59,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take it off!</font>

778
00:31:59,720 --> 00:32:01,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- I'm not hot. I'm fine, Mom.
- It's hot!</font>

779
00:32:03,790 --> 00:32:04,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't worry.</font>

780
00:32:05,030 --> 00:32:06,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's nothing wrong with our family.</font>

781
00:32:06,590 --> 00:32:08,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're all fine. Perfectly healthy.</font>

782
00:32:08,240 --> 00:32:09,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His dad's healthy too.</font>

783
00:32:09,510 --> 00:32:10,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He just... likes dressing up.</font>

784
00:32:11,270 --> 00:32:12,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Help yourselves to some food and drinks.</font>

785
00:32:12,720 --> 00:32:13,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here.</font>

786
00:32:13,070 --> 00:32:14,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll be right back.</font>

787
00:32:16,860 --> 00:32:20,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[In Memoriam]</font>

788
00:32:20,270 --> 00:32:21,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You little brat!</font>

789
00:32:21,830 --> 00:32:23,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll beat you senseless!</font>

790
00:32:23,160 --> 00:32:23,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please stop hitting me!</font>

791
00:32:24,000 --> 00:32:25,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll beat you senseless!</font>

792
00:32:25,440 --> 00:32:25,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That hurts!</font>

793
00:32:27,880 --> 00:32:29,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Oh, so you know it hurts?</font>

794
00:32:29,720 --> 00:32:31,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What about how I feel?</font>

795
00:32:31,400 --> 00:32:31,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Uncle Wang.</font>

796
00:32:32,640 --> 00:32:33,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hexu?</font>

797
00:32:33,270 --> 00:32:33,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

798
00:32:34,110 --> 00:32:34,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come here.</font>

799
00:32:35,040 --> 00:32:35,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I won't do it again!</font>

800
00:32:35,810 --> 00:32:36,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You get a great view from here.</font>

801
00:32:39,000 --> 00:32:39,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What brings you here?</font>

802
00:32:40,440 --> 00:32:42,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I brought Wang Can his clothes.</font>

803
00:32:42,400 --> 00:32:43,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're so thoughtful.</font>

804
00:32:45,200 --> 00:32:45,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at my wife.</font>

805
00:32:45,680 --> 00:32:47,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- That form, that intensity...
- She's chasing him around.</font>

806
00:32:47,960 --> 00:32:49,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's trained in kung fu since she was young.</font>

807
00:32:52,790 --> 00:32:54,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ever since Wang Can went to Beijing,</font>

808
00:32:54,310 --> 00:32:56,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">our house hasn't been this lively.</font>

809
00:32:57,400 --> 00:32:58,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll beat you senseless!</font>

810
00:32:58,270 --> 00:32:59,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll beat you senseless!</font>

811
00:32:59,880 --> 00:33:00,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where are you going?</font>

812
00:33:00,920 --> 00:33:02,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where are you going? Stop right there!</font>

813
00:33:02,200 --> 00:33:03,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, how's Wang Can been?</font>

814
00:33:05,920 --> 00:33:06,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's still chasing him.</font>

815
00:33:06,640 --> 00:33:08,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone likes him. He's got a great reputation,</font>

816
00:33:08,590 --> 00:33:09,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">mostly for his filial piety.</font>

817
00:33:10,590 --> 00:33:11,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Exactly.</font>

818
00:33:12,030 --> 00:33:13,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Filial piety comes first.</font>

819
00:33:14,070 --> 00:33:16,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've taught him about it since he was little.</font>

820
00:33:16,830 --> 00:33:17,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's always been a good child</font>

821
00:33:17,790 --> 00:33:19,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and very respectful of his mom and me.</font>

822
00:33:21,270 --> 00:33:22,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where do you think you're going?</font>

823
00:33:22,640 --> 00:33:23,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing?</font>

824
00:33:23,270 --> 00:33:23,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get back here!</font>

825
00:33:23,790 --> 00:33:25,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We each take a different role in parenting.</font>

826
00:33:26,510 --> 00:33:28,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She may be the one doing all the disciplining,</font>

827
00:33:28,680 --> 00:33:30,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but I'm the one who sets the overall direction.</font>

828
00:33:31,400 --> 00:33:32,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's the strict mom,</font>

829
00:33:32,510 --> 00:33:33,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and I'm the loving dad.</font>

830
00:33:34,790 --> 00:33:36,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She wouldn't be hitting him if there were other options.</font>

831
00:33:37,070 --> 00:33:37,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Me?</font>

832
00:33:37,830 --> 00:33:38,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've never hit him.</font>

833
00:33:38,880 --> 00:33:40,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've never laid a finger on him.</font>

834
00:33:41,160 --> 00:33:42,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I reason with him.</font>

835
00:33:43,310 --> 00:33:43,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This...</font>

836
00:33:44,160 --> 00:33:45,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is what you call positive reinforcement.</font>

837
00:33:46,160 --> 00:33:47,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I encourage him, compliment him, and praise him.</font>

838
00:33:49,000 --> 00:33:50,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He tells me everything on his mind,</font>

839
00:33:51,240 --> 00:33:52,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but not his mom.</font>

840
00:33:52,440 --> 00:33:53,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For example,</font>

841
00:33:53,510 --> 00:33:54,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">once this beating is over,</font>

842
00:33:55,000 --> 00:33:55,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll go inside</font>

843
00:33:56,160 --> 00:33:57,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and give him a great big hug.</font>

844
00:33:58,440 --> 00:33:58,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll say,</font>

845
00:33:59,200 --> 00:33:59,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">"Son,</font>

846
00:34:00,830 --> 00:34:01,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm on your side.</font>

847
00:34:02,400 --> 00:34:03,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You did exactly the right thing."</font>

848
00:34:05,070 --> 00:34:06,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tell me, with parenting like that,</font>

849
00:34:06,960 --> 00:34:07,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how could he</font>

850
00:34:07,680 --> 00:34:09,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">not turn out cheerful and positive?</font>

851
00:34:10,110 --> 00:34:11,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just go play mahjong, Mom.</font>

852
00:34:11,800 --> 00:34:12,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Play mahjong?</font>

853
00:34:12,510 --> 00:34:14,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've got something more important to deal with!</font>

854
00:34:15,510 --> 00:34:16,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You... get out of my house!</font>

855
00:34:17,000 --> 00:34:17,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't come back!</font>

856
00:34:18,710 --> 00:34:19,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's about enough.</font>

857
00:34:20,150 --> 00:34:21,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's probably getting tired.</font>

858
00:34:22,150 --> 00:34:23,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Time for me to step in.</font>

859
00:34:43,000 --> 00:34:44,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang Can!</font>

860
00:34:46,670 --> 00:34:47,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop right there!</font>

861
00:34:47,480 --> 00:34:48,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Open the door!</font>

862
00:34:48,400 --> 00:34:49,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You little brat!</font>

863
00:34:49,840 --> 00:34:50,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll beat you senseless!</font>

864
00:34:50,630 --> 00:34:51,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My dad's coming!</font>

865
00:34:52,740 --> 00:34:53,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop right there!</font>

866
00:34:56,850 --> 00:34:57,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's getting another beating.</font>

867
00:34:57,900 --> 00:34:59,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Let's go. - Let's go.</font>

868
00:35:30,480 --> 00:35:30,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can,</font>

869
00:35:31,920 --> 00:35:32,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what are you doing?</font>

870
00:35:33,670 --> 00:35:34,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Getting a ride.</font>

871
00:35:38,550 --> 00:35:40,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was a little hard on you yesterday.</font>

872
00:35:40,800 --> 00:35:41,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sorry about that.</font>

873
00:35:42,110 --> 00:35:43,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But you really got on my nerves.</font>

874
00:35:43,550 --> 00:35:44,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That was way out of line.</font>

875
00:35:46,280 --> 00:35:47,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cancel it.</font>

876
00:35:47,510 --> 00:35:48,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The car's almost here.</font>

877
00:35:49,510 --> 00:35:50,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just listen to me.</font>

878
00:35:50,710 --> 00:35:51,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give me that.</font>

879
00:35:52,110 --> 00:35:54,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- It's really almost here...
- It's canceled.</font>

880
00:35:55,110 --> 00:35:56,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You know what being a parent means?</font>

881
00:35:56,590 --> 00:35:58,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You have to pave the way for your child</font>

882
00:35:58,800 --> 00:36:00,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and make sure he has a ride.</font>

883
00:36:01,800 --> 00:36:02,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then</font>

884
00:36:03,400 --> 00:36:04,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you watch him go</font>

885
00:36:05,360 --> 00:36:07,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and say to him in your mind, "Don't look back.</font>

886
00:36:08,550 --> 00:36:09,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And don't thank me."</font>

887
00:36:10,030 --> 00:36:10,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I won't look back.</font>

888
00:36:11,110 --> 00:36:12,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And I won't thank you.</font>

889
00:36:12,960 --> 00:36:14,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't this the key to our scooter?</font>

890
00:36:14,710 --> 00:36:15,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You made it sound like a sports car.</font>

891
00:36:15,590 --> 00:36:17,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just put in a high-capacity Li-ion battery.</font>

892
00:36:18,320 --> 00:36:19,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One charge</font>

893
00:36:19,320 --> 00:36:20,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">gets you 70 kilometers.</font>

894
00:36:21,280 --> 00:36:22,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The repair guy called it</font>

895
00:36:22,840 --> 00:36:24,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the Lamborghini of electric scooters.</font>

896
00:36:24,880 --> 00:36:25,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's still a scooter.</font>

897
00:36:27,670 --> 00:36:28,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">See?</font>

898
00:36:28,760 --> 00:36:30,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This beats taking a cab, doesn't it?</font>

899
00:36:32,280 --> 00:36:33,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All right, I'm off.</font>

900
00:36:33,670 --> 00:36:34,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dad.</font>

901
00:36:34,550 --> 00:36:35,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you're giving me the scooter,</font>

902
00:36:35,280 --> 00:36:35,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how are you getting to work?</font>

903
00:36:35,920 --> 00:36:37,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Uncle Chen bought a new car.</font>

904
00:36:38,030 --> 00:36:38,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">From now on,</font>

905
00:36:39,150 --> 00:36:40,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he'll pick me up for work.</font>

906
00:36:41,320 --> 00:36:42,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll get to enjoy AC</font>

907
00:36:42,960 --> 00:36:44,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and recline in leather seats.</font>

908
00:36:45,400 --> 00:36:45,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait.</font>

909
00:36:46,190 --> 00:36:47,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If Uncle Chen is picking you up,</font>

910
00:36:47,360 --> 00:36:48,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">why can't he give me a ride too?</font>

911
00:36:48,440 --> 00:36:49,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No way.</font>

912
00:36:50,670 --> 00:36:52,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's my connection.</font>

913
00:36:52,320 --> 00:36:54,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You need to build your own.</font>

914
00:36:55,440 --> 00:36:55,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All right,</font>

915
00:36:56,030 --> 00:36:56,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm off.</font>

916
00:36:57,440 --> 00:36:57,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Uncle Chen</font>

917
00:36:57,920 --> 00:36:58,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is about to get here.</font>

918
00:37:00,030 --> 00:37:00,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dad.</font>

919
00:37:01,190 --> 00:37:02,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why's the scooter dead?</font>

920
00:37:02,760 --> 00:37:04,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Maybe I forgot to charge it.</font>

921
00:37:05,550 --> 00:37:06,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You'll figure something out.</font>

922
00:37:21,630 --> 00:37:22,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mao Erzhe!</font>

923
00:37:25,880 --> 00:37:26,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What deity are you praying to</font>

924
00:37:27,320 --> 00:37:28,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this early in the morning?</font>

925
00:37:28,110 --> 00:37:28,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Superstitious nonsense.</font>

926
00:37:29,550 --> 00:37:30,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Making wishes?</font>

927
00:37:30,880 --> 00:37:33,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wished for my man Can to stay indestructible.</font>

928
00:37:34,150 --> 00:37:36,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wished you a speedy recovery.</font>

929
00:37:36,960 --> 00:37:38,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You put them up to this, didn't you?</font>

930
00:37:38,670 --> 00:37:39,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why did you have to tell everyone?</font>

931
00:37:41,070 --> 00:37:42,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't you get beaten up pretty badly yesterday?</font>

932
00:37:42,550 --> 00:37:43,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where are you hurt?</font>

933
00:37:43,710 --> 00:37:44,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm indestructible.</font>

934
00:37:45,800 --> 00:37:46,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Internal injuries.</font>

935
00:37:56,860 --> 00:37:59,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Please obey traffic regulations]</font>

936
00:37:59,000 --> 00:38:00,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can, I'll mix you some medicine when we get there.</font>

937
00:38:01,360 --> 00:38:02,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Will you give it a rest?</font>

938
00:38:07,000 --> 00:38:08,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Slow down, or you'll wipe out!</font>

939
00:38:09,110 --> 00:38:10,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If he does, I'll do his makeup.</font>

940
00:38:20,840 --> 00:38:21,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir,</font>

941
00:38:21,360 --> 00:38:22,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this is the one I want.</font>

942
00:38:22,480 --> 00:38:23,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look.</font>

943
00:38:23,280 --> 00:38:24,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Unidirectional Airflow]
This unidirectional airflow design</font>

944
00:38:24,800 --> 00:38:25,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is beautiful.</font>

945
00:38:26,110 --> 00:38:27,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Separate air supply and exhaust systems.</font>

946
00:38:27,920 --> 00:38:28,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That way,</font>

947
00:38:28,630 --> 00:38:30,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">our contaminated, semi-contaminated, and clean zones</font>

948
00:38:30,030 --> 00:38:31,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">can form a perfect</font>

949
00:38:31,550 --> 00:38:32,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">controlled pressure gradient.</font>

950
00:38:32,670 --> 00:38:33,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How great is that?</font>

951
00:38:33,280 --> 00:38:33,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What brand?</font>

952
00:38:34,110 --> 00:38:34,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This one.</font>

953
00:38:34,760 --> 00:38:35,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Amazing.</font>

954
00:38:36,230 --> 00:38:37,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't understand a word he just said.</font>

955
00:38:37,800 --> 00:38:38,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't write it down wrong,</font>

956
00:38:39,030 --> 00:38:39,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">okay?</font>

957
00:38:39,490 --> 00:38:40,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Fresh-Air System]</font>

958
00:38:40,360 --> 00:38:41,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing?</font>

959
00:38:41,630 --> 00:38:42,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dandan,</font>

960
00:38:42,590 --> 00:38:43,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">look!</font>

961
00:38:45,920 --> 00:38:46,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A funeral expo?</font>

962
00:38:47,480 --> 00:38:48,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who's going to the funeral expo?</font>

963
00:38:48,590 --> 00:38:49,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cao,</font>

964
00:38:49,670 --> 00:38:50,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are you going?</font>

965
00:38:50,630 --> 00:38:51,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

966
00:38:51,550 --> 00:38:52,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why didn't you tell me?</font>

967
00:38:52,670 --> 00:38:53,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've been so busy.</font>

968
00:38:53,360 --> 00:38:54,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I haven't had a chance to clear it with you.</font>

969
00:38:54,960 --> 00:38:56,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then this time, can our team</font>

970
00:38:56,190 --> 00:38:57,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">go on a shopping spree?</font>

971
00:38:57,630 --> 00:38:58,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Absolutely.</font>

972
00:38:59,360 --> 00:39:00,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Has anyone mentioned the fresh-air system?</font>

973
00:39:00,550 --> 00:39:01,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Me. It's in the notes.</font>

974
00:39:01,710 --> 00:39:02,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, then it's my turn.</font>

975
00:39:02,920 --> 00:39:03,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me make a wish.</font>

976
00:39:04,000 --> 00:39:04,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm telling you, Cao,</font>

977
00:39:04,760 --> 00:39:06,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've had my eye on this for ages.</font>

978
00:39:08,030 --> 00:39:09,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Xiangu Tech]
Xiangu Tech's split-type</font>

979
00:39:09,150 --> 00:39:11,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Mortuary Refrigeration Cabinets]
frost-free refrigeration cabinets.</font>

980
00:39:11,280 --> 00:39:12,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bring me back a few of these,</font>

981
00:39:12,760 --> 00:39:14,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and whatever tea you and the higher-ups want this year,</font>

982
00:39:14,230 --> 00:39:15,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it's all on me.</font>

983
00:39:15,630 --> 00:39:16,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">With an offer like that,</font>

984
00:39:16,800 --> 00:39:17,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have to make it happen!</font>

985
00:39:18,000 --> 00:39:18,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Leave it to me!</font>

986
00:39:18,760 --> 00:39:19,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Deal.</font>

987
00:39:19,800 --> 00:39:20,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- It's Xiangu Tech. - What do you think?</font>

988
00:39:21,030 --> 00:39:21,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't forget.</font>

989
00:39:22,960 --> 00:39:23,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir,</font>

990
00:39:24,110 --> 00:39:25,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want the Jiujang Gangzhi rechargeable</font>

991
00:39:25,510 --> 00:39:26,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Jiujang Mortuary Trolley]
hydraulic mortuary lifting trolley.</font>

992
00:39:27,230 --> 00:39:28,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Slow down. What was that?</font>

993
00:39:28,670 --> 00:39:30,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Jiujang Gangzhi rechargeable hydraulic mortuary lifting trolley.</font>

994
00:39:30,960 --> 00:39:31,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

995
00:39:31,510 --> 00:39:32,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shuang often dresses the deceased,</font>

996
00:39:33,000 --> 00:39:33,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and she has a bad back.</font>

997
00:39:33,920 --> 00:39:35,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This will make things easier for her.</font>

998
00:39:35,190 --> 00:39:36,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're the best.</font>

999
00:39:38,110 --> 00:39:38,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shuang, what about you?</font>

1000
00:39:38,960 --> 00:39:40,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't really need anything for myself.</font>

1001
00:39:40,230 --> 00:39:41,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But Hexu</font>

1002
00:39:41,440 --> 00:39:43,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">sometimes has to clean bodies off-site.</font>

1003
00:39:43,230 --> 00:39:45,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The conditions aren't ideal.</font>

1004
00:39:45,480 --> 00:39:46,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I saw this</font>

1005
00:39:46,230 --> 00:39:48,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Haishi Qingyu mobile mortuary washing unit.</font>

1006
00:39:49,150 --> 00:39:50,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Maybe we could get one?</font>

1007
00:39:50,800 --> 00:39:52,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you two putting on a sisterhood act for me?</font>

1008
00:39:52,800 --> 00:39:53,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You two are</font>

1009
00:39:54,000 --> 00:39:55,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">making me look selfish.</font>

1010
00:39:56,150 --> 00:39:57,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How could you be selfish?</font>

1011
00:39:57,360 --> 00:39:58,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The fresh air from that system</font>

1012
00:39:58,710 --> 00:39:59,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">isn't just for you.</font>

1013
00:39:59,960 --> 00:40:01,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We all get to breathe it.</font>

1014
00:40:02,110 --> 00:40:03,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then I guess I'm the most selfless.</font>

1015
00:40:03,280 --> 00:40:04,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's fine, Mao.</font>

1016
00:40:04,510 --> 00:40:06,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir, I'll pick something for Mao:</font>

1017
00:40:06,190 --> 00:40:08,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a 3D-carved biodegradable urn.</font>

1018
00:40:08,400 --> 00:40:09,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's that for?</font>

1019
00:40:09,550 --> 00:40:10,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">To show how close we are as brothers.</font>

1020
00:40:10,920 --> 00:40:12,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Oh, cut it out. Stop causing trouble,</font>

1021
00:40:12,510 --> 00:40:13,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang Can.</font>

1022
00:40:13,190 --> 00:40:14,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I still haven't dealt with you</font>

1023
00:40:14,920 --> 00:40:16,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for secretly swapping duties with Mao.</font>

1024
00:40:16,190 --> 00:40:16,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait.</font>

1025
00:40:16,630 --> 00:40:17,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can't blame Mao</font>

1026
00:40:18,000 --> 00:40:18,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or me for that.</font>

1027
00:40:18,800 --> 00:40:20,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can't crush the spirit</font>

1028
00:40:20,190 --> 00:40:21,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of a boy who loves to learn.</font>

1029
00:40:22,360 --> 00:40:23,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I did it so I could learn properly</font>

1030
00:40:23,670 --> 00:40:24,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">from Second Level Chen Hexu.</font>

1031
00:40:24,800 --> 00:40:27,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I told you to learn from Hexu,</font>

1032
00:40:27,360 --> 00:40:28,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">not do anything else.</font>

1033
00:40:35,000 --> 00:40:35,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't do anything else.</font>

1034
00:40:40,360 --> 00:40:41,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That wasn't entirely my fault.</font>

1035
00:40:41,360 --> 00:40:42,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She was the one who insisted that I...</font>

1036
00:40:42,920 --> 00:40:43,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What?</font>

1037
00:40:43,550 --> 00:40:44,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You didn't like it?</font>

1038
00:40:45,190 --> 00:40:46,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, I did.</font>

1039
00:40:54,070 --> 00:40:55,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll be gone for three days,</font>

1040
00:40:55,550 --> 00:40:57,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and Dandan will handle the schedule, okay?</font>

1041
00:40:57,710 --> 00:40:58,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I saw that.</font>

1042
00:40:58,550 --> 00:40:59,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why does it take three days this time?</font>

1043
00:40:59,880 --> 00:41:01,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Doesn't it usually take just one day?</font>

1044
00:41:01,110 --> 00:41:02,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This one's in Qingdao,</font>

1045
00:41:02,110 --> 00:41:03,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and it's a much bigger event.</font>

1046
00:41:03,630 --> 00:41:04,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's an opening ceremony</font>

1047
00:41:04,630 --> 00:41:06,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and all kinds of networking events and receptions.</font>

1048
00:41:06,190 --> 00:41:07,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Three days is already tight.</font>

1049
00:41:08,230 --> 00:41:08,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's fine, Dandan.</font>

1050
00:41:08,760 --> 00:41:10,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you worried about?</font>

1051
00:41:10,440 --> 00:41:12,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Cao barely has a presence around here anyway.</font>

1052
00:41:12,280 --> 00:41:13,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's only three days.</font>

1053
00:41:13,110 --> 00:41:14,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But Mr. Cao is like our team mascot.</font>

1054
00:41:15,230 --> 00:41:16,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cao may not do much</font>

1055
00:41:16,280 --> 00:41:17,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">around here day to day.</font>

1056
00:41:17,960 --> 00:41:20,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He just holds a few meetings, talks himself up a little,</font>

1057
00:41:20,400 --> 00:41:21,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and has tea with the higher-ups.</font>

1058
00:41:22,070 --> 00:41:23,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But when he's around,</font>

1059
00:41:23,110 --> 00:41:24,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">busy as we are,</font>

1060
00:41:24,480 --> 00:41:25,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the cases we get are usually routine.</font>

1061
00:41:26,630 --> 00:41:27,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Whenever he's away,</font>

1062
00:41:27,960 --> 00:41:28,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">something big tends to happen.</font>

1063
00:41:29,920 --> 00:41:33,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Exactly. Three days is 72 hours.</font>

1064
00:41:34,000 --> 00:41:35,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Anything could happen.</font>

1065
